    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Moyo Ng'wela mu bazunya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ī haha gūtīho nsango ū kū banhū abo balī mulī Kilisito Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mulī Kilisito Yesu, ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa Moyo shanitungūlile, shūnīnja ū mu shilagīlo sha shibi na kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ū mhayo ūyo gwalī gūtadūlīkanile kwītwa mu nzīla ya shilagīlo, īsho shitī na nguzu kūlwa nguno ya būgokolo wa mīlī, ū Mulungu wagwītile aho wantūma ū Ng'wana wakwe kwiza, alī mu suso ya mīlī gwa shibi kūlwa nguno ya shibi; ū mu mīlī gwenūyo ūshinha nsango ī shibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu bise yūshikīlījiwa īyo īgongilwe na būtūngīlīja bo mu shilagīlo, a bise abo tūtashimīzīlaga mu nhūngwa ja mīlī, abo tūkashimīzīlaga mu nhūngwa ja Kiimoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno abo balī na kikalīle ka kūlondeela nhūngwa ja mīlī, bakadīlīlaga ya mīlī. Alīyo abo balī na kikalīle ka kūlondeela nhūngwa ja Kiimoyo, bakadīlīlaga ya ng'wa Moyo Ng'wela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī liganiko lya nhūngwa ja mīlī, lījīlīīlile mu kūcha, alīyo ī liganiko lya nhūngwa ja kūfuma kūlī Moyo līkenhaga būpanga na mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī liganiko lya nhūngwa ja mīlī līlī lya wanishi ū kūlī Mulungu, lītī na widohya ū kū shilagīlo sha ng'wa Mulungu; nīyo lītūdūla ū kwīta ī gīko na hado yaya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose abo bakashimīzīlaga mu nhūngwa ja mīlī batūdūla ū kūnyeja ū Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a bing'we mutī ba nhūngwa ja mīlī, mulī ba nhūngwa ja ng'wa Moyo, nguno ū Moyo wa ng'wa Mulungu akikalaga mu bing'we. Alīyo ūlū ose ose atī nang'hwe ū Moyo wa ng'wa Kilisito, ū ng'wenūyo atī wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Kilisito ūlū alī mu bing'we, ū mīlī gwing'we gūchile kūlwa nguno ya shibi, alīyo ū moyo gūlī mpanga kūlwa nguno ya būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū Moyo wakwe ūyo akanjūūcha Kilisito kūfuma mu bafu ūlū wikala mo ū mu bing'we, ūyo akanjūūcha Kilisito ng'wenūyo akwīyinha būpanga nī mibīlī ying'we ī ya kūcha, mu nzīla ya ng'wa Moyo ūyo alī mu bing'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū badūgū bane, tūlī na būgasa, gwike ītī kūlwa mīlī, gīkī twikale mu nhūngwa ja mīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū ng'wikala mu nhūngwa ja mīlī numho ng'wakūmbūla kūcha, alīyo ūlū ng'ūshibūlaga ī shītīle sha mu mīlī kūlwa nguzu ja ng'wa Moyo, mukūbiza bapanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pye abo bakatongeelagwa na Moyo wa ng'wa Mulungu, balī baana ba ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkī mutanukūlile moyo gwa būsese, gīkī mushoke hangī kwikala mu booba; alīyo ng'wamalile kūng'wanukūla Moyo wa kūng'wīta kūbiza baana; ū mulī wei tūkalīlaga “Aba,” Baba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ū Moyo akakaanīlaga hamò nī myoyo yise gīkī tūlī baana ba ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ūlū tūlī baana, hū kūhaya tūlī bingīji, bingīji ū kūlī Mulungu, bingīji hamò nang'hwe ū Kilisito; ūlū tūluhiwa hamò nang'hwe, gīkī nū kūgūngūhiwa tūlagūngūhiwe hamò nang'hwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ikūjo īlo līkūbiza ho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakūbūbalaga ū būluhi w'ikanza lya haha gīkī būtigelile ū kūgelanījiwa nī likūjo īlo līkoolechiwa kūlwa nguno yise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ī shiseeng'wa shilindanile mu kwisagīlwa kūtaale kūshisha līshike ī likanza lya koolechiwa a baana ba ng'wa Mulungu, bamanīke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī shiseeng'wa shilī ha sīlīlī ya būsugi bo mihayo ītī na solobo, ītī kūlwa būtogwa washo, alīyo kūlwa nguno yakwe ūyo ashitūūlile a ha sīlīlī ya būsugi wenūbo, mu kwisagīlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī shiseeng'wa nasho shikūtungūlwa, shīnge ū mu būsese wa būkenaagūki, shingīle mu wiyabī w'ikūjo lya baana ba ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūmanile gīkī pyī ī shiseeng'wa shikūgang'hīlaga na kūsaatwa hataale kūshisha nī haha yenīyī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ītī gīko dūhū, alīyo na a bise abo tūlī na matwajo ga kwandya ga ng'wa Moyo, nise tūkūgang'hīlaga ū mu būmunhū wise ū bo mu gatī, nguno tūgūlindīīlile na ng'hūmbū nhaale ū mhayo gwa kwītwa a bise kūbiza baana, hū kūkomoolwa kwa mīlī gwise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno tūpījiwe kūlwa kwisagīlwa; ī gīsī ū kwisagīlwa ūlū kwandya kūbonwa, angū numho kūtī kwisagīlwa, nguno ū munhū akūshiisagīlwa ginehe īsho alīshibona? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū tūtūshibonaga īsho tūshiisagīlilwe, tūkūshilindīīla mu wiyūmīlīja būtaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo hangī ū Moyo akatūgunanhaga ū mu būgokolo wise, nguno a bise tūtamanile ū kūlomba gīt'ūmo shitwigeleelilwe, alīyo ū Moyo akatūlombelaga wei ng'wenekīlī, nīyo mu būgang'hīji ūbo būtadūgije kūsomboolwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū Ngīsīlīja wang'holò ja banhū alīmanile ī liganiko lya ng'wa Moyo, ūyo akabalombelaga a beela gīt'ūmo Mulungu atogelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūmanile gīkī, ū kū banhū abo bantogilwe Mulungu, abo bitanwa mu kasolele kakwe, pyī ī shikolo shikatūmamaga mu būsangī būmò kūlwa kwenha yawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno abo abamanile kūfuma kale hū bene abo abasolile kūfuma kale, gīkī babize mu suso ya Ng'wana wakwe; ū wei ū Ng'wana abize tangi mu badūgū bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama abo abasolile kūfuma kale hū bene abo abitanile; abo abitanile hū bene abo ababalīlile būtūngīlīja, abo ababalīlile būtūngīlīja hū bene abo abagūngūhije.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būtogwa bo ng'wa Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose tūhaye mhayo kī ū mu yose yenīyī? Ū Mulungu ūlū alī kū lwandī lwise, nani ūyo akūtūchaama? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo atangugīlile Ng'wana wakwe ng'wenekīlī gete, alīyo akamfunya kūlwa nguno yise pye a bose, akūleka ginehe ū kūtwinha dalali pyī ī shikolo hamò nang'hwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani ūyo adūgije kūbabūūla a basolwa ba ng'wa Mulungu? Nguno ū Mulungu h'ūyo akūbabalīlaga būtūngīlīja! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Al'ū wa kūbasola būbi nani? Ū Nombeji wise ū ng'wene alī kū nkono gwa būlyo gwa ng'wa Mulungu; h'ū Kilisito Yesu ūyo akacha, hama na kūtinda ho a henaho, ūjūūka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani ūyo adūgije kūtūlekanya nabo ū būtogwa bo ng'wa Kilisito? Hamo ūlū būluhi, nūūlū makoye, nūūlū kūzwangana, nūūlū nzala, nūūlū būzuuka, nūūlū nhabaala, nūūlū līlūshū? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo gwandīkīlilwe; gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
